{"id":"4002810f6b7b5431","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-graph-planar-graph.md","title":"ZFC Graph Planar Graph","display":"df-zfc-graph-planar-graph — ZFC Graph Planar Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-planar-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-planar-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-planar-graph — ZFC Graph Planar Graph","depends_on":["[[58-df-graph]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-planar-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-planar-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-planar-graph — ZFC Graph Planar Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,X,E,v,a\\in V\">\\(G,X,E,v,a\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(I,\\tau_I)\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(I,\\tau_I)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}=\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},2)\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2}=\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},2)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>。这些唯一拓扑使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^2\">\\(\\mathbb R^2\\)</span> 是二坐标有限函数向量空间。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"58-df-graph\">58-df-graph</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\\)</span> (vertex-and-arc drawing predicate defined here).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPlanarGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPlanarGraph}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}drawing}\\vdash \\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(v,X,\\mathbb R^2)\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(v(x)=v(y)\\to x=y))\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\{c\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\mathbb R^2):\\mathrm{Function}(c,I,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(c,I,\\tau_I,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,E,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(e=\\{x,y\\}\\land a(e)(0)=v(x)\\land a(e)(1)=v(y)\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(a(e)(s)=a(e)(t)\\to s=t)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(a(e))\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(v)=\\{v(x),v(y)\\}\\bigr)\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E\\;\\bigl(e\\neq e&#39;\\to\\operatorname{ran}(a(e))\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(a(e&#39;))=\\{v(x):x\\in e\\cap e&#39;\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}plane\\text{-}drawing}\\vdash \\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(v,X,\\mathbb R^2)\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(v(x)=v(y)\\to x=y))\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\{c\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\mathbb R^2):\\mathrm{Function}(c,I,\\mathbb R^2)\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(c,I,\\tau_I,\\mathbb R^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb R^2})\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,E,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(e=\\{x,y\\}\\land a(e)(0)=v(x)\\land a(e)(1)=v(y)\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(a(e)(s)=a(e)(t)\\to s=t)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(a(e))\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(v)=\\{v(x),v(y)\\}\\bigr)\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E\\;\\bigl(e\\neq e&#39;\\to\\operatorname{ran}(a(e))\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(a(e&#39;))=\\{v(x):x\\in e\\cap e&#39;\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}planar\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphPlanarGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,E,v,a\\in V\\;\\bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}planar\\text{-}graph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphPlanarGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,E,v,a\\in V\\;\\bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{PlaneDrawing}_S(v,a;X,E)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vertices and edge arcs are explicit set-coded functions. Injectivity, vertex avoidance, and pairwise edge-intersection conditions replace the formerly undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GraphRealization}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GraphRealization}_S\\)</span> primitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnc